<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Comm Edison and Pacific Gas.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Comm Edison and Pacific Gas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for Commonwealth Edison and Pacific Gas and Electric Co first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity for both issues is initially limited to $5 million per firm on a first-come, first-served basis, MBIA said.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
</text>
